{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Please, stop there, that's close enough","We don't know you, give us some room","I'm asking you to turn around","Stay back a little, will you?","Don't make me keep asking, please","You can pass by, just don't come in here","This is where we're staying, find another way round","Wait there, I'm not letting you any closer","I heard you, but you still need to back away","Please don't push past me","Go back the way you came, I can't let you stay","You've seen me, now give me some space"}},
{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=law",{"Hold up, {sir}, this area's closed","Stay on your side, please","I need you to turn around and leave","No entry, take another route","Stop there, that's as far as you go","Give me a little room, {sir}","I'm keeping this area clear, move back","Don't cross over, you need to stay outside","You've been told this area is closed","Back up slowly. Quick movements make me jumpy","Not through here, {sir}, turn back","Keep your distance while I'm talking to you"}},
{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=military,elite,swat",{"Halt there, this sector is restricted","Keep moving, away from our position","Do not approach, turn back","You're too close to the perimeter, move out","That's close enough, stay outside our line","No passage through this position","Return the way you came, do not advance","I see you, hold there and listen","Move back until I tell you to stop","You are entering a secured area, withdraw","Stay clear of this post, you can't remain here","Whatever you need, ask from back there","Armed or not, you can't stay here - move outside the perimeter"}},
{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hold it, this place is taken","You lost? Keep going, then","Back up, you're getting real comfortable","Don't come strolling through here","Nobody invited you, turn yourself around","Go find somewhere else to stand","I can hear you fine from over there","Not another step into our place","Whatever you're selling, take it somewhere else","You're crowding me, take the hint","I said stay out, not come and introduce yourself","This ain't a place you wander into, get back"}},
{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=military,elite,swat|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"This area's closed - turn around and go back out"}},
{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=law|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"{sir}, you need to leave this area - back the way you came"}},
{"CAREFUL_KEEP_BACK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned",{"We're staying here - please, don't come any further - go back out"}},
{"CAREFUL_LAST_WARNING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"No, stop, I said don't come any closer","I've asked you nicely, that's enough now","One more time, turn around and leave","You need to go, right now","Don't take another step this way","I'm done asking, get back","Please go before this gets worse","Why are you still coming? Back off!","This isn't a bluff, get away from me","I said no, you're not coming through","That's your last warning, leave me alone","Back out, now, don't make me do this"}},
{"CAREFUL_LAST_WARNING","reg=law",{"{Sir}, I have told you to leave, do it now","That's the last time I ask, step back","You heard the warning, move outside this area","Do not try to walk past me again","Stop advancing, I won't say it twice","I was clear with you, back the way you came","Enough, {sir}, leave immediately","I'm not negotiating access, get out","We can end this with you turning around","Don't make this any harder, start moving back","The answer is still no, and your warning is over","Leave now, keep your hands away from your belt"}},
{"CAREFUL_LAST_WARNING","reg=military,elite,swat",{"Final warning, withdraw from this position","Halt! Do not advance another step","Your warning is over, move back now","You have been ordered out, comply","Stop closing on our position, this is your last chance","Back across the perimeter, immediately","No further warning, turn around","Break off your approach, you are not cleared through","You heard me, retreat from the post","Do not test us, get clear of this area","I'm giving you one chance to leave, take it","That's far enough, your next move needs to be back"}},
{"CAREFUL_LAST_WARNING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You deaf? I told you to get out","Keep coming and find out, or turn around now","No more talking, get the hell back","That was me asking nicely, we're past that","I'm not moving out of your way, you move","This is your last chance to walk off","Take another step and this gets ugly","Get out before I lose what's left of my patience","You got your warning, don't waste it","Quit playing with me and back the fuck up","I'm serious, get your ass away from here","Walk off while I'm still letting you"}},
{"CAREFUL_LAST_WARNING","reg=military,elite,swat|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"You need to be outside this area - last warning"}},
{"CAREFUL_LAST_WARNING","reg=law|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"I told you to leave - go back out, I'm not asking again"}},
