{"CHECK_IN","",{"Radio check, radio check, anybody there?","Breaker one-nine, anybody got their ears on?","Checking in, still kicking, over","This is us, still here, still breathing","Hello? Hello? Anybody hear me?","Come in, come in, come in, please","Testing, one two, one two, can you hear me?","Come back, come back, you're breaking up","Static, static, static, hell","Just letting you know we're okay, that's all, that's all","Any of you boys out there? Anybody at all?","Radio's working, at least, that's something","Hey, you still with us? Check in","Keeping the line open, in case anyone needs it","Haven't heard a voice all day, say something, say anything"}},
{"CHECK_IN","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Please answer, please, please, I need to hear a voice","Can anybody hear me? Is anybody out there?! Please!!","Oh God, nothing but static, nobody's answering","Batteries are dying, come on, don't die on me"}},
