{"CHECK_IN","reg=law,swat",{"Unit check, unit check, 10-4, all quiet","Dispatch, do you copy? Dispatch? ...nothing","10-20, my location is the east lot, how copy","Unit twelve to anyone, unit twelve to anyone","Sheriff's office frequency, nobody's picking up","Still on duty, still in service, 10-8","Status, people, anyone hurt?","Count off, now","Report, everyone alright?"}},
