{"CHECK_IN","reg=military,elite",{"Alpha to base, status green, over","Bravo-six to any station, how copy, over","Radio check, say again, I read you two by five","Foxtrot to net, all callsigns report","Standing by for orders, over","Roger, we're up, we're on, nothing to report","Sound off, status","Check your sector, report any injuries"}},
