{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=law",{"He's right on top of us!","Close! Too close!","Back up! He's right there!","Too close, too close, back away","Right on top of me, request assist","In my face, can't draw, can't draw","Too close to talk, too close to shoot","They're too close. Keep your distance","Get back, get BACK, sheriff's office!","He's right in my personal space, I'm moving off"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=swat",{"Close! Right there!","Too close! Watch yourself!","Right on me!","Too close, close, close","Danger close, hands on","In my bubble, in my bubble","Too close! Give me a hand!","Right here, right here, fighting back","Right in front, taking it, taking it"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=military,elite",{"Too close! Be ready!","Right there! Ten meters!","Close in! Watch it!"}},
