{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"In your face!","He's right here!","Close one! Get him!"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Huh?! Wh- they're right HERE!","Ssst- Pssst- they're right behind us, don't turn around","Right here, right here, I could touch him!","Nnngh- no, not this close, God!","Uh, guys? They're, like, RIGHT THERE","It's right there, I could spit on it!","Mother of- they're on top of us!","Hands up, hands up, no wait, they're not even people, ugh","Right in front of us, never even saw them come","Too sudden, too sudden, my heart, my HEART","Eek- sorry, sorry, I jumped, they're just so close","Look, look, they're practically in my lap"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"They're on us, spread out, swing wide!","They're in our faces, brace","They're close, don't spread out","Close quarters, cover your own flank","Right here, don't lose your head","Close, tight, shoulder to shoulder, now","Up close and personal, no help for it","They got in close, deal with it, fast","Don't back into each other, move apart, swing clear"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=angry",{"They slipped right up on us, goddamn it, who was watching?!","Right in our faces, who let them get this close?!"}},
