{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=military",{"Too close. We need room","Danger close, sir, they're all over us","They're past the perimeter, sir, close quarters","Hands on, hands on, sir, assist me","Right in front of me, I've got no clear shot, sir"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","role=soldier_green",{"Sir, sir, SIR, they're right on us","It's, it's, it's so close, I can hear it breathing","I can't, I can't, they're right THERE"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=elite",{"Close, fighting back","Too close! Keep back!","Danger close, handling"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"They're right fucking here!","Close! Close! Holy shit, they're close!","Aw, come on, how'd they get so close?","In my face! In my damn FACE!","Fuckers are right up on us, shoot, SHOOT","Back up, back up, they're on top of us!","Whoa, whoa, whoa, within arm's reach, my God","They're on us, they're on us, who's got a knife?","Don't let them get any closer, push them back, PUSH","Hey, personal space, jackass, back OFF"}},
{"CLOSE_CONTACT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Oh, you're right here, how convenient","Come closer, closer, that's it... lovely"}},
{"COLD","",{"Cold, my fingers have stopped working","I can see my breath inside the house, that's not right","My feet went numb an hour ago, thought I'd mention it","Should've grabbed the good gloves, the ones with the lining","It's the damp that does it, goes right through the coat","Wind's cutting straight through this jacket","Can't feel my nose - is it still there?","My ears hurt, ears, of all things","Stiff all over, I need to move or I need a fire","Is it me or is it colder in the shade of these buildings?","My knuckles split open, dry cold does that","I keep tucking my chin down into my collar - doesn't help","Cold coffee would be a luxury, I'd settle for warm water","Boots are frozen stiff, walking feels like walking on stumps","The cold sneaks up on you, then it's all you can think about","It's freezing, my fingers are going numb","Cold, cold, so cold","Frost on the glass, can you see your breath?","My teeth are chattering, I can't stop them","Winter's coming, I can feel it in my bones","Brr, brr, brr, brr, brr","Wind cuts right through my coat","My nose is numb, my toes are numb, everything's numb","Ice on the puddles, crack, crack, crack","Cold as a well digger's belt buckle","I need gloves, where are my gloves, I had gloves","Cold as cornbread, cold as a witch's tit, cold as the grave","Can't feel my face, I think I'm smiling, I'm not","My hands are like claws, I can't hold anything"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=building",{"I'd give a week's rations for a space heater and a wall socket"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Dad always said wear the hat - Dad was right","I'm freezing - can we find a blanket?","My hands are numb, I can't feel my fingers"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'm so cold I can't think straight - is there a fire anywhere?","Can we stop somewhere warm? Just for a little while?"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Cold gets into the joints, worse every day","You wear everything you own and you're still cold"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|world=vehicle",{"Frost on the inside of the windshield, last time I looked - fun"}},
{"COLD","role=family_elder",{"These old bones don't take the cold like they used to"}},
{"COLD","role=worker",{"Twenty years on a loading dock in January, still hate it"}},
{"COLD","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Stay dry first, warm second, wet is what kills you"}},
{"COLD","role=rescue_medical",{"Cold hands - warm them before I touch anybody","Warm them slowly, not fast, slow warming, listen to me"}},
{"COLD","role=rescue_clergy",{"Even the Lord's winter is hard on the knees"}},
{"COLD","reg=law,swat",{"Cold as a well-digger's ass out here, gotta keep moving","Trigger finger's gone stiff, I can't have that","This duty belt weighs a ton and keeps none of the cold off","Freezing patrol, hands numb on the radio","Standing watch in this cold, can't move, can't sit, miserable"}},
{"COLD","reg=military,elite",{"Feet go first - Frostbite takes the feet - check your socks","Cold, keep your hands warm, trigger finger especially","Check your toes, frostbite starts there","Layer up, no excuses, check your buddy"}},
{"COLD","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Hands in your armpits when you're idle - beats gloves","Cold's a condition, not a threat, doesn't mean I like it","Cold's just cold, you endure it"}},
{"COLD","role=soldier_nco,law_sergeant,swat_lead",{"Rotate to the fire in pairs, nobody freezes on my watch"}},
{"COLD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Damn it's cold, I'd trade a rifle for a heater right now","Freezing my butt off out here - whose idea was this?","Hell, my teeth are about to crack","I'm freezing my ass off, let's find shelter","Freezing my balls off out here","Fuck, it's cold, give me a fire, anything","Damn weather, damn cold, damn this whole situation","Body heat, huddle up, don't be shy, I won't tell"}},
{"COLD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Cold enough to freeze spit - get a fire going before I hurt somebody","Take a coat off somebody who doesn't need it anymore - worth a thought"}},
{"COLD","reg=law",{"Cold out here, I'm losing feeling in my hands"}},
{"COLD","reg=military",{"Need to warm my hands. Can't feel them"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"I'm so cold I can't think, I can't think straight","We can't stay out here, we'll freeze, we'll freeze to death","If we get caught outside in this, we won't make it"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"Mama's quilt, I'd give anything for Mama's quilt","Feels colder when you're on your own"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Layers, layers, layers, put on everything you've got","Share body heat, sit close, close as you can","Gotta keep moving or I'll freeze solid","Cover your face, your hands, your head, that's where the heat leaks out"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm|world=building",{"Need a fire or a stove or any corner out of the wind"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"I can't feel my toes, can you feel my toes? Are they still there?","Brass monkey weather, my old man used to say"}},
{"COLD","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=angry",{"Damn cold, I hate cold, why does it have to be cold"}},
{"COLD","reg=rescue",{"Slurred speech, confusion... when the shivering stops it's bad","Everyone in blankets, I don't care how silly it looks"}},
{"COLD","reg=swat",{"Cold weather, rotate watch more often, keep hands moving"}},
{"COLD","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"I'm not freezing to death over this shit"}},
{"COLD","hour=21,4",{"Coldest part of the night, right before dawn","Midnight chill, bone-deep, hands tucked in armpits"}},
{"COMBAT_ATTACK","",{"No you don't!","Leave me alone!","Get off me!","I've had enough of you!","You want this? Fine!","I'm not giving up!","Away! Get away!","Oh, fuck this!","Keep your distance!","Don't come any closer!","I'm fighting my way out!","You leave me no choice!","Try me, then!","I'm still here!","This ain't how I die!","Not without a fight!","Enough! Enough of this!","You stay the hell away!","I said leave it!","I won't let you!","Don't you touch me!","Come on! Come ON!","I'll get through this!","You picked the wrong time!","I'm done being scared!","Oh, you bastard!","Get away, goddammit!","I ain't finished!","Stay back!","Get away from me!","Come on, then!","I'm not dying here!","Back off!","You won't get me!","Not today!","Get back!"}},
{"COMBAT_END","",{"Easy. Don't rush into anything else","Let me catch up with myself","Keep looking. I'm not relaxing yet","I don't trust quiet as much as I used to","Take a breath. Keep your eyes open","Please let that be enough for now","Don't wander off just yet","Let's think before we move again","I could use a little less excitement","Give it a moment. No hurry now","I need to hear myself think","Stay careful. I don't want a surprise","Let's not get careless at the end","I hope we don't have to do that again","That's it, it's done","That's all of them, that's all of them, we're okay","No more movement, nothing moving","Alright, stand down, stand down","Weapons down, weapons down, easy","It's over, for now","Last one's down","Silence, listen, silence","Nothing left, nothing left to shoot","We held, we held the line","Breathe, everybody, breathe","We're through it, we're through it"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=law",{"Alright, it's over - everybody check yourselves","It's quiet, holster up, but stay sharp","That's done, somebody write down what happened here","Okay, breathe - nobody touch anything yet","That's it - check the bodies, careful","Done - Lord, I hated every second of that"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=swat",{"All quiet - sound off","Threat's down - check your gear","Looks clear, nobody relax yet","That's it - good work - reload","Done - everybody still in one piece?","Quiet, hold here a minute and listen","Sector clear, stand down, clear weapons"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=military,elite",{"Cease fire! Cease fire!","Area's quiet - Consolidate on me","That's the last of them, reload and share out the ammo","Check fire, sound off with your status","Good, everybody up - ammo count","Cease fire, cease fire, check your arcs","Fighting has stopped, report in, over","Stand easy, but stay ready"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=military,elite|world=vehicle",{"Fight's over - get the wounded to the truck"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Is it over? Tell me it's over","Oh God, okay - okay, they stopped","I think that's all of them","My ears are ringing - is everybody alright?","I need to sit down, I'm sitting down","Is anybody hurt? Say something"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hah! That's how it's done!","Done - go through their pockets","Who's still breathing? Not them","Serves 'em right! Grab the good shit before it's gone","Quit hollering, it's over - load up","Easy money, mostly"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Is it done? Tell me it's done","I don't believe it, I don't, is it a trick?"}},
{"COMBAT_END","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Done, reload, regroup, move","Good, now we get out of here"}},
