{"COME_WITH_ME_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh",{"No, I'm done going anywhere... but the guys who took my car sleep at {den}, somebody oughta do something","Thank you, but no, the men who shot my brother are at {den} - if you go, don't go alone","I'm staying put, hon, you look like you can handle yourself, though - there's a gang at {den} bleeding this town dry","Please don't ask me again, they took my sister at {den}, and I can't go anywhere near that side of town","I don't want to, everybody I go with dies, the people who killed Dale are at {den}, if you're the kind who fixes things","Sorry, I'm not brave - somebody braver than me should pay a visit to {den} - that's where the robbers stay","No thank you, I trusted people once this week - they're sitting at {den} now with my rifle","I'm not going anywhere, this is my house, but the ones who shot Mr. Hensley are camped at {den}","I can't, my legs are shot, you seem decent, they robbed us near {den} - please be careful if you go","I don't know you, I'm sorry, I don't know anyone anymore, the robbers are at {den}, that's all I know for sure","Not today, maybe not ever - whoever robbed the church was last seen heading into {den}","I'm too tired, but you look like somebody who could make them stop - they're at {den}, they killed Jimmy","Maybe if things were different, they took my boy's bike and laughed about it, then rode it back toward {den}","You're kind to ask - but no, if you ever reach {den}, tell them somebody still remembers Curtis","Can't - won't, the ones who took everything I had are hiding at {den} - please, bring some peace to this county","I'll only slow you down, the ones you want are at {den} - they tie red rags around their arms","I've got nothing left to go with you for, they shot my dog at {den} - just shot him for barking","No, I'm sorry, no, if you want to be a hero, start at {den} - that's where they took Linda's truck","I have to stay by the CB, my sister might call in - the robbers are at {den}, by the way - keep away, or don't","I don't go anywhere anymore, not since {den}, they left me for dead there, and I just about was","Not me, I'd be useless in a fight... but {den}, somebody's gotta go, they took our water and our Frank","No, but thank you, it's nice to be asked, the robbers are camped at {den}, I heard their truck all night","I'm staying, I don't have much, but it's mine, those thieves at {den} would take even that","I don't trust anybody enough to walk with them, not after {den}, they acted friendly too, at first","Please, I can't, my hands still shake, the ones who did this are at {den} - you look like you don't shake","I'm headed to Rosewood alone - sorry, if you go anywhere near {den}, go armed, that's where the robbers are","No, no, I've lost my whole family, I can't lose a stranger too - the robbers who shot my father are at {den}","I told my mother I'd stay put till she gets back - the ones who robbed us went to {den} - please don't get hurt","The Army said stay indoors, so I'm staying, nobody said a word about those crooks at {den}, though","Go with you? I'd be one more thing for you to lose - the people at {den} haven't lost anything, maybe they should","I'm sorry, I'm really sorry, they took my daughter's stuffed rabbit at {den} - who takes that?","No, I tried leaving once, got as far as {den} before they caught me, I'm not trying again","Thank you, honestly, but I'd rather die in my own kitchen - the robbers? They're at {den} - go carefully","I'm not a fighter, I teach piano - taught, the ones who broke my fingers are at {den}","Sorry, no, I keep thinking they'll come back, the robbers from {den} - they said they would","I.. I can't - I'm sorry, my friend Marcy is still out there somewhere, they dragged her off to {den}","No, my legs don't work right and my nerve don't either - the ones you want sit at {den}","Thank you, no, I'd be dead weight - there's a crew at {den} that ain't dead weight at all","I'm staying with the grave - it's fresh, the men who made it went back to {den}","I'd slow you down and then I'd get you killed - the robbers are at {den} - go careful","Can't, I promised Wanda I'd be here when she got back - they took her truck to {den}","No thank you, if you head toward {den}, there's a dog tied up there - cut him loose"}},
