{"COME_WITH_ME_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|world=building",{"No, I... no, I keep the porch light on for my son, but the thieves who took our food, they're at {den}","Go with you? I can barely walk to the mailbox - the ones at {den} killed my neighbor, do some good if you can","I'm sorry, I can't, somebody has to feed the Tolliver kids next door, the animals who took their folks are at {den}"}},
{"COME_WITH_ME_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|world=road",{"I'd just get us both killed - listen, the people at {den} robbed half the families on my street","No, not the road. And not anywhere near {den}","Sorry, I'm the one who stays - somebody cleans out {den}, this road could breathe again"}},
{"COME_WITH_ME_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|sex=m",{"I buried my wife in the garden, I'm not leaving her - the ones who did it ride out of {den}","No, I carried mail here thirty years, I know every house - the robbers took over {den}, wasn't theirs to take"}},
