{"CONTAINER_SEARCH","",{"What've we got in here","Careful, careful, don't break anything","Drawers, cabinets, shelves, move it","Something rattling in the back, hang on","Dig through it, there's gotta be something","Check the pockets of every coat","Underneath, check underneath, people hide things under things","Hey, hey, there's a false bottom, feel that?","Maybe behind the boxes, hold the light","Oh come on, open, open, you stubborn thing","Peel the lid, slow, slow, not too loud","Pull out the whole thing, see what's behind it","This one's heavy, this one's actually heavy","Crates, boxes, bags, go through all of them","Take your time, quiet hands"}},
{"CONTAINER_SEARCH","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Hurry, hurry, we can't stay long","Is anyone coming? Does anyone hear that? Is anyone coming?","I hate opening these, I hate not knowing what's inside","Something moved, something MOVED in there, no, it's a sock, it's a sock"}},
{"CONTAINER_SEARCH","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Slow, put things back like we found 'em","Systematic, top to bottom, left to right","Everything back where it was, in case we return"}},
{"CONTAINER_SEARCH","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Rummaging through people's underwear, my mama didn't raise me for this","If I find a casserole in here, I'm leaving"}},
{"CONTAINER_SEARCH","reg=rescue",{"Looking for anything useful, bandages, antiseptic, anything","Careful with the glass, careful, I'll check this one"}},
