{"CORPSE_FOUND","",{"Is that a body? Yeah, that's a body","Dead, definitely dead, been dead for a bit","There's a corpse here, give it room","Someone lying still, too still","Corpse, ripe one, mouth breathing now","Don't poke it, don't prod it, leave it be","That's a dead man, or what's left of one","Careful where you step, careful","Gone, he's gone, nothing left to do","There's a corpse. Keep your distance for now","Skin's gone gray, that's not good, not at all","Look at the hands, he put up a fight","Her eyes are open, I'd rather they weren't","His mouth's open like he was about to say something","Whoever it was left their shoes, that's strange"}},
{"CORPSE_FOUND","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"No, no, no, no, I'm not going in there, you go in","Is that what we're going to look like? Is that-","It's just lying there like a, like a bag, like a bag of laundry","God- the SMELL, oh God the smell","Are we in danger? Is it contagious, being near them?","I'm not touching that, I can't, I can't","I keep seeing his face, I'm gonna keep seeing his face","Do they stay dead? Is this one staying dead? Tell me it's staying dead"}},
