{"CORPSE_FOUND","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Seen it, move along, don't stare","Corpse, old, leave it, keep going","Whoever it was, they're past worrying now","Nothing to salvage, nothing to learn, let's go","Wash your hands later, don't touch your face"}},
{"CORPSE_FOUND","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=grim",{"Count the ones I've seen, count the ones I couldn't help, same number","Funny how you stop being scared of the dead, only the ones who aren't","Nobody's buried a thing in this county in a week"}},
